            "review_title": "Review at Nha Vien Restaurant",
            "review_text": "BluePlanet76\n21 contributions\n0\nLooks great but so so\nSep 2017 • Friends\nWent there on Sunday night, we were the only table during the meal. \n1. our table was not cleaned properly, still some leftovers when we sit down and no further cleaning actions from staffs, went directly to order.\n2. one of the dishes was grill prawn, surprisingly it was served quickly, mostly nice and warm but the tip of the heads and the tails were cool. Maybe they pre-cook them before grill.\n3. usually for each VNese dish, there will be a different sauce to dip with, we were offered only 1 (pepper salt) for all, in the meantime, staffs were just talking and singing among themselves. \n4. we didn't go with any VNese locals this time, staffs couldn't communicate in English or Chinese, so we tried our best to communicate in VNese. it's common for a VNese not try harder to guess/understand what a foreigner with poor VNese speaking, a bit frustrated.\n\nby the way, the view/setup was great.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 28, 2017",
            "rating": 3.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
