            "review_text": "Peter H\nNuremberg, Germany120 contributions\n0\nexcellent food and scenery\nJan 2013 • Business\nGot introduced to this restaurant by accident. Had some business to do there and it was great. When entering the restaurant you enter a Garden with a small lake and small water flows. Tables are in open houses. Everything done in a Vietnamese nice way. The food we had was excellent. You have to go and try by yourself. Its worth it.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 27, 2013",
